# Pathspecs the template's own PII scan skips, one per line, each with the
# reason. scripts/pii-scan.sh here is a link to the skeleton's, whose built-in
# self-excludes name scripts/pii-scan.sh and .githooks/pre-push at the root,
# so under skel/ they need saying again.
#
# Every project made from skel/ skips these two by construction (each has
# quoted the scan's patterns), and the template should give the same answer
# about the same file. If pii-scan.sh drops one of its self-excludes, drop
# the line here too.
skel/scripts/pii-scan.sh
skel/.githooks/pre-push
